[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13021.75, "timestamp": "03:37:01", "text": "呃，这么说吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13024.55, "timestamp": "03:37:04", "text": "太酷了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13027.83, "timestamp": "03:37:07", "text": "这跟我的情况很相似。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13029.91, "timestamp": "03:37:09", "text": "也是，对吧？应该不是第一个补丁吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13032.15, "timestamp": "03:37:12", "text": "第二批，我猜就像视频里那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13036.07, "timestamp": "03:37:16", "text": "齿轮感。二三治来了，然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13042.229, "timestamp": "03:37:22", "text": "嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13045.19, "timestamp": "03:37:25", "text": "然后，嗯，是的，然后还有一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13048.229, "timestamp": "03:37:28", "text": "印度菜之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13052.469, "timestamp": "03:37:32", "text": "是的，印度的流量下降了。那就是我，我仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13055.99, "timestamp": "03:37:35", "text": "希望我能和他们俩都眼神交流。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13057.59, "timestamp": "03:37:37", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13060.389, "timestamp": "03:37:40", "text": "我以前经常看他们的节目。我喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13062.87, "timestamp": "03:37:42", "text": "它们的内容，"}]